      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{设 } A \\text{ “原点与投点的连线与 } x \\text{ 轴的夹角小于 } \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\text{”,}\\\\&amp; \\text{样本空间} S=\\{(x,y)|0&lt;y&lt;\\sqrt{2ax-x^{2}}\\}, \\text{其面积为} \\frac{1}{2}\\pi a^{2};\\\\&amp; \\quad A=\\{(x,y)|(x,y)\\in S, y&lt;x\\}, \\text{其面积为} \\frac{1}{4}\\pi a^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}a^{2}.\\\\&amp; \\text{由几何概率计算公式得} \\quad P(A)=\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}\\pi a^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}a^{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}\\pi a^{2}}=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{\\pi}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{设 } A \\text{ “原点与投点的连线与 } x \\text{ 轴的夹角小于 } \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\text{”,}\\\\&amp; \\text{样本空间} S=\\{(x,y)|0&lt;y&lt;\\sqrt{2ax-x^{2}}\\}, \\text{其面积为} \\frac{1}{2}\\pi a^{2};\\\\&amp; \\quad A=\\{(x,y)|(x,y)\\in S, y&lt;x\\}, \\text{其面积为} \\frac{1}{4}\\pi a^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}a^{2}.\\\\&amp; \\text{由几何概率计算公式得} \\quad P(A)=\\frac{\\frac{1}{4}\\pi a^{2}+\\frac{1}{2}a^{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}\\pi a^{2}}=\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{\\pi}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
